  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The University of Nicosia (UNIC) is a private university in Cyprus and one of the leading research universities in the wider Mediterranean region. Times Higher Education (THE) ranks it among the top 2% of universities in the world and first in Cyprus for Research Quality. UNIC offers over 100 on-campus and online/distance learning programs and also houses the largest medical school in Cyprus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At UNIC, you’ll be in the largest student community in Cyprus, with more than 12,500 students from over 100 countries. You can stay updated on events through the UNIC Student Portal, which features music nights, exhibitions, webinars/workshops, and more.</p><p>Additionally, UNIC organises several events year-round, providing opportunities to meet new people, make friends, and have fun. You can also join various student clubs, including several academic clubs, ethnic clubs, leisure clubs, and sports clubs.</p><p>Furthermore, UNIC’s Student Support Team assists you with personal and academic counselling and guidance by providing you with a dedicated Student Support advisor.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The University of Nicosia provides accommodation on campus in its three separate residence complexes – SIX, U, and Triangle – which are among the most stunning student accommodations ever constructed in Europe!</p><p>UNIC’s student residences provide dining, relaxing, and entertainment options. These options include restaurants, cafes, a mini-market, gyms, games areas, and more. The residences are close to UNIC’s campus, several restaurants, coffee shops, pubs, and bars – all within walking distance.</p><p>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The library at the University of Nicosia is a modern, well-equipped facility, with an extensive range of print and digital resources, including books and journals. The library is open to both students and the public during specified hours.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>UNIC offers you various sports options to choose from and has several sporting facilities inside the campus. The University’s UFIT Fitness Centre is a leading gym in Cyprus, with state-of-the-art equipment and experienced instructors.</p><p>UNIC also offers various recreational sports activities, including bowling, table tennis, beach soccer, beach volleyball, hiking, and diving.</p><p>Not only that, the University of Nicosia is an active member of the Cyprus University Sports Federation (CUSF) in Football (Soccer), Futsal, Basketball, Volleyball, Table Tennis, and the Marathon, with both men's and women’s teams.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>The University of Nicosia offers several specialised labs for hands-on learning and research, in healthcare, technology, and business. These include IT labs, Engineering labs, Architecture labs, Multimedia and Digital Communications labs, Life and Health Sciences labs, and many more.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>There are several restaurants and cafes across the campus and surrounding areas. Loft is the flagship on-campus restaurant, bar and event space. Loft resides on the top floor of the SIX student residence and offers a unique dining experience against the backdrop of Nicosia’s skyline. The Block Restaurant’ on campus is another popular eating spot offering a wide variety of food options for different dietary requirements.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
